ers agree to use their days in accordance with the property rules and regulations.<\\/p><p>## 5. Payment<br \\/>- *Fees*: The fee for the timeshare bundle must be paid in full at the time of purchase.<br \\/>- *Maintenance Fee*: An annual maintenance fee is applicable and must be paid at the beginning of each year.<\\/p><p>## 6. Cancellation and Refund<br \\/>- *Cancellation*: Users may cancel their timeshare bundle within 14 days of purchase for a full refund on condition that no days were used.<br \\/>- *Refund*: No refunds will be provided for unused days unless the cancellation is made within the specified period.<\\/p><p>## 7. Limitation of Liability<br \\/>NomadsHive shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from the user\'s failure to comply with these terms and conditions.<\\/p><p>## 8. Amendments<br \\/>NomadsHive reserves the right to amend these terms and conditions at any time. Users will be notified of any changes through the platform\'s communication channels.<\\/p><p>## 9. Governing Law<br \\/>These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction where the property is located.<\\/p><p>By using NomadsHive\'s timeshare property management services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these terms and conditions.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(16326,1703,'_elementor_version','3.18.2'),(16423,1703,'_elementor_controls_usage','a:4:{s:6:\"spacer\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:1;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:0;s:8:\"controls\";a:1:{s:7:\"content\";a:1:{s:14:\"section_spacer\";a:1:{s:5:\"space\";i:1;}}}}s:6:\"column\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:2;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:0;s:8:\"controls\";a:1:{s:6:\"layout\";a:1:{s:6:\"layout\";a:1:{s:12:\"_inline_size\";i:1;}}}}s:7:\"section\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:2;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:0;s:8:\"controls\";a:0:{}}s:11:\"text-editor\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:1;s:15:\"control